    "title": "Melt and Fill",
    "description": "Hey there! Thank you for your patience and kind feedback, guys! We hear you!\r\n\r\n- Bug fix for the Honeycombs level\r\n- Bug fix for an unexpected price change\r\n- Bug fixes for collision register on some levels\r\n- Overall performance enhancements\r\n\r\nThank you for playing the Melt and Fill game and stay tuned a for new content!\r\n\r\nMelt plastic balls, metal coins, and other different stuff! Try to fill as much bottles as you can to make higher in-game profit! Use it wisely to be able to efficiently upgrade your melting machine and bottles! Then you can melt faster and more to produce higher profit, which you need to complete level and find more substances to melt!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hey there! Thank you for your patience and kind feedback, guys! We hear you!<br><br>- Bug fix for the Honeycombs level<br>- Bug fix for an unexpected price change<br>- Bug fixes for collision register on some levels<br>- Overall performance enhancements<br><br>Thank you for playing the Melt and Fill game and stay tuned a for new content!<br><br>Melt plastic balls, metal coins, and other different stuff! Try to fill as much bottles as you can to make higher in-game profit! Use it wisely to be able to efficiently upgrade your melting machine and bottles! Then you can melt faster and more to produce higher profit, which you need to complete level and find more substances to melt!",
